    "capturedAt": "2026-10-23T08:57:09.118Z",
    "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\n<title>Farmtheory — freeform produce for restaurants and commercial kitchens</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Farmtheory supplies restaurants, cloud kitchens and food processors in Bangalore with freeform fruit and vegetables — cosmetically imperfect, entirely fit to eat, and 25–30% cheaper on procurement. Backed by Y Combinator.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://farmtheory.in/\">\n\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://farmtheory.in/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Farmtheory — saving what's good\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Freeform fruit and vegetables, bought direct from farmers and delivered to kitchens across Bangalore in under 20 hours.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://farmtheory.in/assets/hero-field.webp\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0C604A\">\n\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"assets/favicon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"alternate icon\" href=\"assets/favicon-32.png\" sizes=\"32x32\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"assets/favicon-180.png\">\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n\n<header class=\"site-head\">\n  <div class=\"wrap head-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\" aria-label=\"Farmtheory home\">\n      <img src=\"assets/logo-green.svg\" alt=\"Farmtheory\">\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n      <a href=\"index.html\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a>\n      <a href=\"about.html\">About</a>\n      <a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a>\n    </nav>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"contact.html\">Get in touch</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n\n  <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->\n  <section class=\"hero on-dark\">\n    <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Backed by <img class=\"yc-wordmark\" src=\"assets/yc-wordmark.svg\" alt=\"Y Combinator\"></span>\n        <h1>Great produce doesn’t have to look perfect.</h1>\n        <p class=\"sub\">We supply restaurants, cloud kitchens and food processors across Bangalore with <strong>freeform</strong> fruit and vegetables — cosmetically imperfect, entirely fit to eat, and 25–30% cheaper on procurement.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n          <a class=\"btn light\" href=\"contact.html\">Talk to our sourcing team</a>\n          <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"#freeform\" style=\"color:#fff;border-color:rgba(219,234,183,.45)\">What is freeform?</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-art\">\n        <img class=\"shot\" src=\"assets/hero-field.webp\" alt=\"A farmer holding a freshly pulled bunch of carrots in the field\" width=\"1700\" height=\"956\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= TRUST ================= -->\n  <section class=\"trust\">\n    <div class=\"wrap trust-in\">\n      <p class=\"t-item\"><b>3,000+</b> farmers supplying</p>\n      <p class=\"t-item\"><b>800–1,000</b> kitchens served</p>\n      <p class=\"t-item\"><b>~20 tonnes</b> delivered daily</p>\n      <p class=\"t-item\"><b>&lt;20 hrs</b> order to doorstep</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= FREEFORM ================= -->\n  <section class=\"sec tint\" id=\"freeform\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">The produce</p>\n        <h2>This is what <span class=\"hl\">freeform</span> looks like.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Around 30% of a farmer’s harvest goes unsold on appearance alone — too small, misshapen, rain-marked, scarred. The food is unaffected. Only the grading standard says otherwise, and once it is chopped, puréed or fried, nobody can tell the difference.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ff-grid\">\n        <figure class=\"ff\">\n          <img src=\"assets/freeform-cauliflower.webp\" alt=\"A cauliflower head with brown scarring across the florets\" width=\"900\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <figcaption class=\"cap\"><p class=\"tag\">Scars &amp; rain-marks</p><p>Surface marking from weather and handling. No effect on taste, texture or yield.</p></figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure class=\"ff\">\n          <img src=\"assets/freeform-onions.webp\" alt=\"Red onions with split and flaking outer skins\" width=\"900\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <figcaption class=\"cap\"><p class=\"tag\">Skin-out</p><p>Outer skin split or shed in storage. The onion underneath is untouched.</p></figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure class=\"ff\">\n          <img src=\"assets/freeform-cucumber.webp\" alt=\"A cucumber with a pale blemish along one side, held above a crate\" width=\"900\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <figcaption class=\"cap\"><p class=\"tag\">Bulged &amp; pinched</p><p>Grown against a stone or a stem. Rejected on shape, identical once sliced.</p></figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure class=\"ff\">\n          <img src=\"assets/freeform-carrots.webp\" alt=\"A handful of carrots of uneven size and shape\" width=\"900\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <figcaption class=\"cap\"><p class=\"tag\">Broken ends &amp; too small</p><p>Off-spec on length or grade. Exactly the same carrot in a stock or a mirepoix.</p></figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= WHY ================= -->\n  <section class=\"sec\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">For kitchens</p>\n        <h2>Lower food cost, without lowering the food.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\">We buy freeform produce direct from farms and take it straight to your kitchen. Fewer hands in the chain means a lower price to you and a better one to the farmer.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"cards\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">25–30%</p>\n          <h3>Saved on procurement</h3>\n          <p>Typical savings for our food business partners against their previous sourcing cost.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">&lt;20 hrs</p>\n          <h3>Order to doorstep</h3>\n          <p>Ordered today, delivered tomorrow — picked, packed and routed on our own fleet.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">All grades</p>\n          <h3>Perfect to freeform</h3>\n          <p>Take freeform where it makes no difference, premium where it shows on the plate.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">Chains</p>\n          <h3>Every outlet, one account</h3>\n          <p>Every outlet on one account, with pricing, invoices and approvals split by role.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= PRODUCE STRIP ================= -->\n  <div class=\"strip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"wrap strip-in\">\n      <img src=\"assets/p-tomato.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <img src=\"assets/p-broccoli.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <img src=\"assets/p-corn.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <img src=\"assets/p-cabbage.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <img src=\"assets/p-romanesco.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <img src=\"assets/p-chard.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <img src=\"assets/p-pumpkin.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= -->\n  <section class=\"sec\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">How it works</p>\n        <h2>Four steps, one supply chain.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Conventional produce passes through agents, the mandi and a wholesaler before it reaches a kitchen. Every stop adds a markup and a day of shelf life. We removed them.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"steps\">\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <h3>Bought at the farm</h3>\n          <p>Collection centres at farm level buy the whole harvest — including the freeform grades no one else will take.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <h3>Sorted and packed</h3>\n          <p>Graded, weighed and packed at our distribution centre, with the final weight recorded at the moment of packing.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <h3>Priced to your kitchen</h3>\n          <p>Pack sizes and pricing matched to what your kitchen actually consumes, rather than one catalogue for everyone.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <h3>Delivered to the door</h3>\n          <p>On our own fleet, in under 20 hours from order, anywhere we operate in Bangalore.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= APP ================= -->\n  <section class=\"sec dark on-dark\">\n    <div class=\"wrap split\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Ordering</p>\n        <h2>The whole account, in one app.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.8rem\">Order the day’s list, see what is cheap today, settle invoices and manage every outlet from one place — or just send us a WhatsApp, and we will put it in for you.</p>\n        <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n          <li><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M1.5 6.2 4.4 9 10.5 3\" stroke=\"#0C604A\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><span><b>Role-based access</b><span class=\"d\">Procurement sees orders and pricing, finance sees invoices across outlets, chefs see what is cheap today.</span></span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M1.5 6.2 4.4 9 10.5 3\" stroke=\"#0C604A\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><span><b>Order on WhatsApp</b><span class=\"d\">Keep ordering the way your team already does. We enter it into the system on your behalf.</span></span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M1.5 6.2 4.4 9 10.5 3\" stroke=\"#0C604A\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><span><b>Wallet and credit</b><span class=\"d\">Balances, dues and payment status in one view, across every outlet on the account.</span></span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M1.5 6.2 4.4 9 10.5 3\" stroke=\"#0C604A\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><span><b>Freeform recipes</b><span class=\"d\">Ideas from our kitchen team for putting off-spec produce to work without waste.</span></span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"app-shot\">\n        <img src=\"assets/app-catalogue.webp\" alt=\"Farmtheory ordering app showing the day's catalogue, prices and add-to-order buttons\" width=\"620\" height=\"881\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= IMPACT ================= -->\n  <section class=\"sec tint\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sec-head\">\n        <p class=\"kicker\">Impact</p>\n        <h2>Every crate is food that was going to be thrown away.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Buying the whole harvest changes the economics on both ends — the farmer sells what would have been left in the field, and the kitchen pays less for it.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cards\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">200,000 kg</p>\n          <h3>Saved every month</h3>\n          <p>Food that would otherwise have been written off, redirected to kitchens instead.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">~20% more</p>\n          <h3>Earned by farmers</h3>\n          <p>On produce they had no route to sell, from a buyer who takes the whole field.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">1.07M litres</p>\n          <h3>Of water, per partner</h3>\n          <p>Saved each year by a typical food business partner, alongside 1,152&nbsp;kg of CO₂.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p class=\"num\">3,600 kg</p>\n          <h3>Of produce, per partner</h3>\n          <p>Rescued every year — enough to feed 10,000 school children through a mid-day meal.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= CTA ================= -->\n  <section class=\"cta on-dark\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <h2>Find out what your kitchen would save.</h2>\n      <p>Send us your current produce list and we will come back with a comparison, usually within a day.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn light\" href=\"contact.html\">Get in touch</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-foot\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"foot-top\">\n      <div>\n        <img src=\"assets/logo-white-tagline.svg\" alt=\"Farmtheory — saving what's good\">\n        <p>Freeform fruit and vegetables, bought direct from farmers and delivered to kitchens across Bangalore.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Company</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"about.html\">About</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Get in touch</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"mailto:hello@farmtheory.in\">hello@farmtheory.in</a></li>\n          <li>Bangalore, Karnataka, India</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot-bot\">\n      <span>© 2025 Farmtheory. All rights reserved.</span>\n      <span class=\"yc-line\">Backed by <img class=\"yc-wordmark yc-wordmark-sm\" src=\"assets/yc-wordmark.svg\" alt=\"Y Combinator\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"
  }
]
